-- title:
--   Joint archimedean confinement of norm-one ideles with bounded twisted ratio
-- statement:
--   Let $K$ and $L$ be number fields with $L$ an extension of $K$ that is Galois, and let $\sigma$ be an element of $\mathrm{Gal}(L/K)$ such that every $\tau \in \mathrm{Gal}(L/K)$ lies in the subgroup of integer powers of $\sigma$ (so the group is cyclic, generated by $\sigma$). Let $A$ be a ring automorphism of the infinite adele ring $L_\infty = \prod_{w \mid \infty} L_w$ subject to the following compatibility: for every infinite place $v$ of $K$ and every unit $t$ of $L_\infty$, the $v$-fibre of $A(t)$ — that is, the tuple of coordinates of $A(t)$ at the places $w$ of $L$ with $w \circ \mathrm{id}_{K \to L} = v$, as produced by [`AutomorphicForm.TransversalMeasure.archFibre`](def/AutomorphicForm_TransversalMeasure.html#L54) — coincides, as an element of $\prod_{w \mid v} L_w$, with the image of the $v$-fibre of $t$ under the automorphism obtained by transporting $\mathrm{id}_{K_v} \otimes \sigma$ of $K_v \otimes_K L$ along the $K_v$-algebra isomorphism [`M4aHerbrand.ArchSemilocal.placeEquivAlg`](def/M4aHerbrand_ArchSemilocal.html#L247) $\colon K_v \otimes_K L \cong \prod_{w \mid v} L_w$. Let $C$ be a compact subset of $L_\infty^\times$. Then there is a compact subset $C_t \subseteq L_\infty^\times$ containing every unit $t$ of $L_\infty$ such that, firstly, for each infinite place $v$ of $K$ the $v$-fibre of $t$ lies in `archNormOneUnits`, the kernel of the map sending a unit of $\prod_{w \mid v} L_w$ to the absolute value in $\mathbb{R}$ of its $K_v$-algebra norm, and secondly $A(t)\,t^{-1} \in C$.
--
--   This is the archimedean confinement step in the twisted (Galois-ratio) analysis of the transversal variable: boundedness of the twisted ratio $A(t)t^{-1}$ together with the norm-one condition at every infinite place of $K$ forces $t$ into a fixed compact subset of $L_\infty^\times$. It feeds the construction of compactly supported transversal integrals in [`AutomorphicForm.TwistedBruhat.exists_forall_integral_transversal_eq_indicator_mul_prod_unipotentOrbitalFn_unram`](thm.html#AutomorphicForm.TwistedBruhat.exists_forall_integral_transversal_eq_indicator_mul_prod_unipotentOrbitalFn_unram).
